Yeah, it will make you poison resistant, but make sure you have a
potion of restore ability.  You'll probably have to eat several bees
before getting the resistance, and if you don't get it you'll watch
your strength go down (same is true of snakes).  Better to eat cave
spiders, brown molds, and certain blobs.  They can give you poison
resistance (less chance), but don't seem to poison you when you eat
them.

